  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 RNA encoder (config_005/006) and resnet50 image encoder (config_030) perform well. This experiment tests whether weighted fusion (vs concat in config_030) improves multimodal performance while keeping RNA/image encoders and aggregation method consistent. It isolates the effect of fusion strategy, which is critical for multimodal models, and builds on prior success with scvi_n200 and resnet50."
